<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend cut by Cowen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend cut by Cowen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on Ascend Communications Inc to neutral from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Ascend's shares were down 2-1/2 at 38-7/8. Its shares also fell on Tuesday following downgrades by UBS Securities and SoundView Financial Group.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
